WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.704
RetailMind opens on observed M5 sales, with source limits visible.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.594
Explore sales by product, store, weekday and holiday.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:24.219
Choose a product and compare models on held-out dates.

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:48.999
The selected model shows backtest error, future demand and an empirical band.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.859
No observed stock means no invented reorder quantity.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.384
Insights explain what the observed sales support.

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:14.639
Review source quality, missing fields and database tools.

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:26.089
Download sales, performance summaries and model evidence as CSV.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.510
Real observations, auditable forecasts, clear limits.
